chapter.v:
	These are 

	 their numbers, according to their fathers’ houses. Of Judah, the captains of thousands: Adnah the captain, and with him three hundred thousand mighty men of valor;
 [Num. 14:9; [2 Chr. 15:2; 32:8]] [Num. 11:25, 26; 24:2; 2 Chr.]

	and next 

	 to him was Jehohanan the captain, and with him two hundred and eighty thousand;
 [Ex. 14:13, 14; [Deut. 1:29, 30; 31:6, 8]; 2 Chr. 32:7 x]

	Of Benjamin: 

	 Eliada a mighty man of valor, and with him two hundred thousand men armed with bow and shield;
 [Ex. 14:13,]
